event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":78,"item_id":"rs_01b356623d4ebeb9016acb548b0f648195bb66a952ccac3aca","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering test notes enhancement**\n\nI’m thinking about how I could enhance my test notes by adding a unique marker before each note. This way, it would be easier to identify and manage each test. I wonder if a consistent approach will help me stay organized and efficient. It’s a simple tweak, but I believe it might make a big difference in readability and clarity. Let's see how that goes!"}

